    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d144">

                <pb facs="0425" n="376" sameAs="frus:frus1977-80v11p1/pg376"/>

                <head>144. Memorandum From the White House Chief of Staff (Jordan) to President
                    Carter, Secretary of State Vance, and the President’s Assistant for National
                    Security Affairs (Brzezinski)<anchor n="1" xml:id="d144-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1980-01-12">undated</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Please find attached summary notes on my discussions today with the Panamanians.
                    Also, several documents which I had translated pertaining to the extradition of
                    the Shah from Panama.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d144-f2"/></p>
                <p>There are no other copies of this document.</p>


                <xi:include href="d144-a1.xml" xpointer="d144-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
